OL,3,AMan dies in crash after police pursuit
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died and two women have been
OL,6,Finjured in a crash after a police
OL,7,Fpursuit near Stratford-upon-Avon.
OL,9,FOfficers tried to stop a black Audi on
OL,10,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,11,FBST on Monday but the driver failed to
OL,12,Fpull over, Warwickshire Police said.
OL,14,FA pursuit began and 15 minutes later
OL,15,Fthe Audi crashed into a white Ford
OL,16,FPuma, the force added, with the Audi's
OL,17,F19-year-old male driver confirmed dead
OL,18,Fat the scene by paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
